# Fixtures whose contents are load-bearing for tests must not be rewritten by
# this repository's own `goneat format` / `make pr-final` runs.
#
# tests/fixtures/python/bad/ holds a deliberately unformatted Python file. The
# runner Python e2e smoke test asserts that `goneat format --check` fails on it
# for format drift rather than for a missing ruff executable. Formatting it
# would make that assertion pass vacuously.
tests/fixtures/python/bad/
